# FS-CCE-390 omission DisclosureEscalationDutyScope
:expect-pins 1

# Missing DisclosureEscalationDutyScope withholds every disclosure consequence, including alternate action.
? obliged(OblSpecialOmit390DisclosureEscalationDutyScopeDisclosureAlternate, OblSpecialOmit390DisclosureEscalationDutyScopeDisclosureAlternateDuty, OblSpecialOmit390DisclosureEscalationDutyScopeDisclosureAlternateStandard).
# => FALSE
